OL,3,GNEWSANew weather warning as third storm
OL,4,Ahits Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new weather warning is in place as a
OL,7,Fthird storm in a matter of days hits
OL,8,FScotland.
OL,10,FIt comes as thousands of homes across
OL,11,Fthe country remain without power in the
OL,12,Faftermath of Storm Boelo.
OL,14,FA yellow wind warning, covering most of
OL,15,Fthe country as well as parts of
OL,16,Fnorthern England and Northern Ireland,
OL,17,Fcame into effect at 03:00 and runs
OL,18,Funtil 21:00 on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
